### Criar receita
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Salario","amount":3000.00,"type":"INCOME","category":"SALARY","date":"2026-10-27"}

### Criar despesa
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Almoco","amount":25.90,"type":"EXPENSE","category":"FOOD","date":"2026-10-27"}

### Listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/transactions?start=2026-10-01&end=2026-10-31&category=FOOD

### Resumo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/transactions/summary?start=2026-10-01&end=2026-10-31

### Texto (exige perfil ai e credencial)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/assistant/text
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Qual meu saldo de 1 a 31 de outubro de 2026?"}
